[tobritt@mars.lerc.nasa.gov (Randall Britton (SVER)) writes:]
[] I am running a wizard who is 28th level with
[] most intrinsics, AC -30, +6 Mojo, +6 Stormy. 
...
[]  Oh, by the way I have long since
[]  obtained +3 gray dragon scale mail so am magic protected.
[] However, I can't find any stairs going down and ...

if you've got teleport control then reading a not cursed scroll of
teleportation while confused will level teleport you. also, reading
a cursed scroll of teleportation, normally, will do the same thing.
a consequence of your magic protection armor is that you aren't affected
by teleport traps else you could use a level teleport trap found on
the upper levels.

[] I was under the impression that if you applied a mirror at yourself
[] while blind that it would tell you which level that the Wiz was
[] on(after you kill Medusa of course).

well, you've got to be lucky ... a blessed luckstone is worth a wish
since these are extremely rare. actually the method won't tell you
where the wizard is but how close you are relative to him. you won't
need to use it since you'll know when you're on the wizard's level.

[] I just thought of ONE LAST question, then I promise to shut up.
[] What is *anybodys* opinion on the strength of my Wiz.  Is he
[] strong enough yet to take on the big Wiz or does he need furhter
[] development? 

no guarantees ... (i'll assume you have >18 Strength and other stats
above 14, mostly, and >150 Hp's) you're ready! use common sense,
look before you leap, consider your alternatives and consequences of
any actions you make and don't count on a lucky break. you've got the
weapons and armor to survive. oh yeah, don't feel obligated to kill
the wizard but do what you must to keep him off your amulet. good luck!

BTW, a stethoscope and Stormy make a nice combo, with these the wizard
can become a wimp, if you're careful ...

